# Publish after every task

When you finish any task that changes the NGMY app, **always publish** to https://ngmy.org/ before ending the turn.

## Deploy steps

1. Build web: `flutter build web --release -t lib/main.dart -o docs`
2. Commit changed source + `docs/` to `main`
3. Push to `origin/main`
4. If rebase conflicts in `docs/`, rebuild web, `git add docs/`, then `git rebase --continue`

Do not skip publish unless the user explicitly says not to deploy, or the task was question-only with zero code changes.

Confirm in the final message that the app was published.
